# F122 ARM B -- the ADJACENT PAIR, as the shipped script issues it: the travel
# is issued right behind the point transition, with NO wait between them, so
# both are executed in the SAME frame by the script interpreter.
# Differs from armA.sts by exactly one removed line (`wait duration 2`).
body action preload name selected
timerate rate 1
flag track_object on
audio filename lift-off.wav action play
wait duration 1
moveto altitude 20000000 duration 3
wait duration 3
camera action transition_to target point name Space
camera action move_to target body body_name selected duration 3 altitude 100000
